        matrices, and sample metadata for long-read direct cDNA
        sequencing of human retinal organoids, 2D retinal ganglion cell
        (RGC) cultures, and flowthrough fractions from H9 and EP1 iPSC
        cell lines. Data were generated using Oxford Nanopore
        Technology (ONT) direct cDNA sequencing and mapped to the
        GRCh38 reference genome (GENCODE v46 annotation). The package
